      "type": "text",
      "content": "Já deixei o checklist ativo no @Notion e marquei somente o que já está comprovado. O próximo item é **`001A — preflight somente leitura`**; ele não altera arquivos nem Docker.\n\nExecute exatamente este bloco no WSL:\n\n```bash\nbash <<'BASH'\nset -Eeuo pipefail\n\nSTAGE=\"CURRENT-IMPL-001A_PRECHECK\"\nCANON=\"/home/davis/projetos/beach-pro\"\nCP=\"/opt/cepraea/pro-control-plane\"\n\nEXPECTED_HEAD=\"dc99cc2e3f6b7aae92b5efc63e051bc5feb5ef4a\"\nEXPECTED_SENTINEL_SHA=\"b9e18a31959d6b82a3503605693e45f0feb9bd9284539b0bc724db1e4ffd500b\"\nEXPECTED_LOCK_SHA=\"1f57f174855bfdf1b0e83f9361c364e8187a400de75834fd2de434f0e06de2c4\"\nEXPECTED_LAUNCHER_SHA=\"1a7c0e11f627db4f8c9c27858b3eeb31da7fee070c18f1c6c0530f3436ee3791\"\n\nFAILS=0\n\npass() { printf 'PASS|%s\\n' \"$1\"; }\nfail() { printf 'FAIL|%s\\n' \"$1\"; FAILS=$((FAILS + 1)); }\n\necho \"STAGE=$STAGE\"\necho \"TIMESTAMP_UTC=$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)\"\necho \"USER=$(id -un)\"\necho \"UID=$(id -u)\"\n\necho\necho \"=== CANONICAL REPOSITORY ===\"\n\nif [ -d \"$CANON/.git\" ]; then\n  pass \"CANONICAL_GIT_EXISTS\"\nelse\n  fail \"CANONICAL_GIT_MISSING\"\nfi\n\nHEAD=\"$(git -C \"$CANON\" rev-parse HEAD 2>/dev/null || true)\"\necho \"CANONICAL_HEAD=$HEAD\"\n\nif [ \"$HEAD\" = \"$EXPECTED_HEAD\" ]; then\n  pass \"CANONICAL_HEAD_MATCH\"\nelse\n  fail \"CANONICAL_HEAD_MISMATCH\"\nfi\n\nBRANCH=\"$(git -C \"$CANON\" branch --show-current 2>/dev/null || true)\"\necho \"CANONICAL_BRANCH=$BRANCH\"\n\nif [ \"$BRANCH\" = \"main\" ]; then\n  pass \"CANONICAL_BRANCH_MAIN\"\nelse\n  fail \"CANONICAL_BRANCH_NOT_MAIN\"\nfi\n\nSTATUS=\"$(git -C \"$CANON\" status --porcelain=v1 2>/dev/null || true)\"\n\nif [ -z \"$STATUS\" ]; then\n  pass \"CANONICAL_WORKTREE_CLEAN\"\nelse\n  fail \"CANONICAL_WORKTREE_DIRTY\"\n  printf '%s\\n' \"$STATUS\"\nfi\n\necho \"CANONICAL_ORIGIN=$(git -C \"$CANON\" remote get-url origin 2>/dev/null || true)\"\n\necho\necho \"=== TRUSTED CONTROL PLANE ===\"\n\nif [ -d \"$CP\" ]; then\n  pass \"CONTROL_PLANE_EXISTS\"\nelse\n  fail \"CONTROL_PLANE_MISSING\"\nfi\n\necho \"CONTROL_PLANE_STAT=$(stat -c '%U:%G:%a' \"$CP\" 2>/dev/null || true)\"\n\ncheck_hash() {\n  local file=\"$1\"\n  local expected=\"$2\"\n  local label=\"$3\"\n\n  if [ ! -f \"$file\" ]; then\n    fail \"${label}_MISSING\"\n    return\n  fi\n\n  local actual\n  actual=\"$(sha256sum \"$file\" | awk '{print $1}')\"\n  echo \"${label}_SHA=$actual\"\n\n  if [ \"$actual\" = \"$expected\" ]; then\n    pass \"${label}_HASH_MATCH\"\n  else\n    fail \"${label}_HASH_MISMATCH\"\n  fi\n}\n\ncheck_hash \\\n  \"$CP/sentinel.txt\" \\\n  \"$EXPECTED_SENTINEL_SHA\" \\\n  \"SENTINEL\"\n\ncheck_hash \\\n  \"$CP/runtime/runtime-image.lock\" \\\n  \"$EXPECTED_LOCK_SHA\" \\\n  \"RUNTIME_LOCK\"\n\ncheck_hash \\\n  \"$CP/runtime/launch-agent-shell.sh\" \\\n  \"$EXPECTED_LAUNCHER_SHA\" \\\n  \"TRUSTED_LAUNCHER\"\n\necho \"SENTINEL_STAT=$(stat -c '%U:%G:%a' \"$CP/sentinel.txt\" 2>/dev/null || true)\"\necho \"RUNTIME_LOCK_STAT=$(stat -c '%U:%G:%a' \"$CP/runtime/runtime-image.lock\" 2>/dev/null || true)\"\necho \"LAUNCHER_STAT=$(stat -c '%U:%G:%a' \"$CP/runtime/launch-agent-shell.sh\" 2>/dev/null || true)\"\n\necho\necho \"=== CURRENT-IMPL-001 TARGET PATH PRECONDITIONS ===\"\n\nfor target in \"$CP/sessions\" \"$CP/candidates\"; do\n  if [ -e \"$target\" ]; then\n    echo \"EXISTING_TARGET_PATH=$target\"\n    fail \"TARGET_PATH_ALREADY_EXISTS\"\n  else\n    echo \"TARGET_PATH_ABSENT=$target\"\n    pass \"TARGET_PATH_AVAILABLE\"\n  fi\ndone\n\necho\necho \"=== RESULT ===\"\n\nif [ \"$FAILS\" -eq 0 ]; then\n  echo \"CURRENT_IMPL_001A_PRECHECK=PASS\"\n  echo \"NEXT_AUTHORIZED=CURRENT-IMPL-001B\"\nelse\n  echo \"CURRENT_IMPL_001A_PRECHECK=FAIL\"\n  echo \"FAIL_COUNT=$FAILS\"\n  echo \"NEXT_AUTHORIZED=NONE\"\nfi\n\nexit \"$FAILS\"\nBASH\n```\n\nEsse comando verifica exatamente as precondições antes de qualquer mutação: baseline canônica, worktree limpa, hashes do Control Plane e ausência dos novos diretórios `sessions/` e `candidates/`. A arquitetura exige que Session seja ancorada a uma baseline explícita e que Candidate Isolation seja implementado antes de qualquer agente receber RW.  \n\n**Cole aqui a saída integral do comando.** A partir dela eu faço `LOG → DIA → GATE`, atualizo o ledger e marco `001A` no checklist do Notion somente se o resultado estiver sustentado pela evidência."
